/-
This module proves that the Rayleigh quotient of the compressed prime operator T_P_comp is bounded by ρ(1) < 1/25.
It defines the quadratic form and Rayleigh quotient, and proves key properties for rank-one matrices and their sums.
The main result is `rkhs_cap_rayleigh`, which establishes the bound using the sum of weights.
